T:Dernière Danse
C:Indila
M:4/4
O:France, 2013
N:Verse and chorus. Melody from the vocal-line channel of a 17-track MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com, track 67520); chords from its bass and choir channels (Cm Fm | Eb G7 throughout). Transposed up a fifth from C minor to G minor to fit the recorder. Humanized onsets snapped to the sixteenth grid; chorus bars 2 and 6 follow the two later choruses, which agree with each other.
